(931629, 107649, 10268, '<td valign="top">You''re color balance is off, a tad, I believe. But yup, wacky.  6.</td>', 'You''re color balance is off, a tad, I believe. But yup, wacky.  6.', '2004-09-29 20:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(931632, 108542, 10268, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even know they still made bugles!  I''ll have to go hunt some down.  The wackiness of the photo isn''t all that strong, but it''s well taken and nice composition.</td>', 'I didn''t even know they still made bugles!  I''ll have to go hunt some down.  The wackiness of the photo isn''t all that strong, but it''s well taken and nice composition.', '2004-09-29 20:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(931633, 108444, 7743, '<td valign="top">With composition, simpler is usually better.  You have a good idea here, however, I think it''s a little too cluttered.  Also, the white balance seems a bit off.</td>', 'With composition, simpler is usually better.  You have a good idea here, however, I think it''s a little too cluttered.  Also, the white balance seems a bit off.', '2004-09-29 20:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(931634, 108239, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  I think the composition could have been more interesting if it were less centered and harshly lit.  The crop was a bit tight.  Focus also appears a little soft.  Love the title.</td>', 'Great subject.  I think the composition could have been more interesting if it were less centered and harshly lit.  The crop was a bit tight.  Focus also appears a little soft.  Love the title.', '2004-09-29 20:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
