(931654, 107798, 10268, '<td valign="top">that actually looks appetizing (sp?)  So good job!  I like the small depth of field, and the colors are nice.</td>', 'that actually looks appetizing (sp?)  So good job!  I like the small depth of field, and the colors are nice.', '2004-09-29 20:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(931658, 108601, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this would have done better as a color shot.</td>', 'I think this would have done better as a color shot.', '2004-09-29 20:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(931666, 107944, 25464, '<td valign="top">I find nothing very interesting about this shot except to try to guess what the yucky is.  Background looks like a wrinkly pillow.  Lighting is too harsh, and the focus is too soft.  Keep trying.</td>', 'I find nothing very interesting about this shot except to try to guess what the yucky is.  Background looks like a wrinkly pillow.  Lighting is too harsh, and the focus is too soft.  Keep trying.', '2004-09-29 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(931681, 107849, 16126, '<td valign="top">I hate this stuff... But it''s a good picture with the dark background and crisp focus, good job.</td>', 'I hate this stuff... But it''s a good picture with the dark background and crisp focus, good job.', '2004-09-29 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(931683, 107882, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very cute strawberries with their tuxedos. Although that is out of the ordinary, the overall composition and point of view is not. I would have liked to see the entire plate in focus. The foreground desserts are blurry so I tend not to give them much attention. The middle piece has a very annoying spotlight. Overall color balance seems biased towards red. The bottom could also be cropped a bit tighter and maybe even to the inner circle of the plate. I would like to crop the odd shape in the lower left corner. And the background pattern is mildly distracting.</td>', 'Very cute strawberries with their tuxedos. Although that is out of the ordinary, the overall composition and point of view is not. I would have liked to see the entire plate in focus. The foreground desserts are blurry so I tend not to give them much attention. The middle piece has a very annoying spotlight. Overall color balance seems biased towards red. The bottom could also be cropped a bit tighter and maybe even to the inner circle of the plate. I would like to crop the odd shape in the lower left corner. And the background pattern is mildly distracting.', '2004-09-29 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(931686, 107841, 25464, '<td valign="top">No composition, focus is soft, keep trying.</td>', 'No composition, focus is soft, keep trying.', '2004-09-29 20:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(931688, 108441, 12393, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement.  Would love to see this with more of the items on the plate in focus and taking up more space with a less cluttered background. Items in the background dont seem to fit with the foreground ...my 2c.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement.  Would love to see this with more of the items on the plate in focus and taking up more space with a less cluttered background. Items in the background dont seem to fit with the foreground ...my 2c.', '2004-09-29 20:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(931689, 107692, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting gourd, focus is ok.  Background blurred nicely but still somewhat distracting.  Centered composition is too boring for such a simple subject.  Pretty good.</td>', 'Interesting gourd, focus is ok.  Background blurred nicely but still somewhat distracting.  Centered composition is too boring for such a simple subject.  Pretty good.', '2004-09-29 20:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
