(931692, 107967, 25464, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft, lighting doesn''t seem quite right.  Composition is not centered which is good.  OK for me.</td>', 'Focus is soft, lighting doesn''t seem quite right.  Composition is not centered which is good.  OK for me.', '2004-09-29 20:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
