(932070, 107597, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Original.  Would have been even better without the blue barrier in the foreground.  I think we get the fun idea that the golf tees mean golf course without the club(?) in front.  Still, lots of ingenuity here...</td>', 'Great idea.  Original.  Would have been even better without the blue barrier in the foreground.  I think we get the fun idea that the golf tees mean golf course without the club(?) in front.  Still, lots of ingenuity here...', '2004-09-30 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
