(932130, 108600, 25464, '<td valign="top">I know there are places in the world where people are forced to eat things like this but I can promise I could never be that hungry.  I predict you are a shoe in for the brown ribbon.  Content will far outweigh any photographic skill for this shot.</td>', 'I know there are places in the world where people are forced to eat things like this but I can promise I could never be that hungry.  I predict you are a shoe in for the brown ribbon.  Content will far outweigh any photographic skill for this shot.', '2004-09-30 00:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(932131, 108601, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and composition.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice contrast and composition.  Good job.', '2004-09-30 00:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(932133, 107013, 26362, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t say wacky to me.. the pear is still a pear, but it''s sitting on a tripod that''s on a clock. Maybe I just don''t get your meaning... the location is wacky, but the food really isn''t.</td>', 'This just doesn''t say wacky to me.. the pear is still a pear, but it''s sitting on a tripod that''s on a clock. Maybe I just don''t get your meaning... the location is wacky, but the food really isn''t.', '2004-09-30 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(932135, 108154, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Shadows are a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Shadows are a little distracting.', '2004-09-30 00:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(932136, 108392, 26362, '<td valign="top">Reminds me more of a college bonfire than of a wacky food.</td>', 'Reminds me more of a college bonfire than of a wacky food.', '2004-09-30 00:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(932139, 107452, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I really like the clarity and the color of this. One of my favorites of this challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done. I really like the clarity and the color of this. One of my favorites of this challenge.', '2004-09-30 00:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(932140, 108009, 25464, '<td valign="top">This food is not that wacky.  The image is too small, and the focus and lighting are a bit off.  It looks like it could have been a good shot.  The stringy part at the bottom could have been interesting.  Keep trying.</td>', 'This food is not that wacky.  The image is too small, and the focus and lighting are a bit off.  It looks like it could have been a good shot.  The stringy part at the bottom could have been interesting.  Keep trying.', '2004-09-30 00:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(932142, 107631, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Very dramatic lighitng.</td>', 'Nice job.  Very dramatic lighitng.', '2004-09-30 00:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(932143, 107644, 26362, '<td valign="top">Ah I get it, a fish in a nest! Great idea, one of the more creative "makes you think" pictures in this competition (which has been lacking for this one). One of my higher ranked ones, good luck!</td>', 'Ah I get it, a fish in a nest! Great idea, one of the more creative "makes you think" pictures in this competition (which has been lacking for this one). One of my higher ranked ones, good luck!', '2004-09-30 00:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(932144, 107847, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a interesting combination.  Composition is ok.  Lighting is probably ok, but the focus appears really soft.  Pretty good overall.</td>', 'This is a interesting combination.  Composition is ok.  Lighting is probably ok, but the focus appears really soft.  Pretty good overall.', '2004-09-30 00:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(932145, 108284, 26362, '<td valign="top">I do like the composition of this piece. Very creative and original. I rated it high, good luck!</td>', 'I do like the composition of this piece. Very creative and original. I rated it high, good luck!', '2004-09-30 00:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(932147, 108604, 18461, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Nice lighting, colors are very vivid and well composed.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Nice lighting, colors are very vivid and well composed.', '2004-09-30 00:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(932149, 107970, 18461, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2004-09-30 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(932150, 107275, 25464, '<td valign="top">I bumped this one up.  Nice coloring. Nice composition.  Illustration of the cliche is interesting.  Good focus.  Good lighting.  No wow, but a very good photo.</td>', 'I bumped this one up.  Nice coloring. Nice composition.  Illustration of the cliche is interesting.  Good focus.  Good lighting.  No wow, but a very good photo.', '2004-09-30 00:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(932152, 108424, 18461, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very cute.  Nice job.', '2004-09-30 00:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(932153, 108323, 26362, '<td valign="top">I remember eating dirt cake when I was little... it was actually pretty good. Unfortunately, since I remember eating it, I don''t really think this combo is all that wacky... rated a 5</td>', 'I remember eating dirt cake when I was little... it was actually pretty good. Unfortunately, since I remember eating it, I don''t really think this combo is all that wacky... rated a 5', '2004-09-30 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(932155, 108502, 18461, '<td valign="top">Very ceative.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very ceative.  Nice shot.', '2004-09-30 00:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(932158, 108590, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2004-09-30 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(932161, 107572, 26362, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get what is wacky about this one... I can see that it''s the only thing on the plate, so it''s probably a reference to some type of "meal in a pill format," but beyond that it just lacks that something special</td>', 'I don''t really get what is wacky about this one... I can see that it''s the only thing on the plate, so it''s probably a reference to some type of "meal in a pill format," but beyond that it just lacks that something special', '2004-09-30 00:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(932163, 108506, 18461, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Very nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'Great job.  Very nice lighting and composition.', '2004-09-30 00:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(932165, 108530, 26362, '<td valign="top">It''s like hamburger helper, but the meat is in patty form. Voted it lower because the quality is too grainy.</td>', 'It''s like hamburger helper, but the meat is in patty form. Voted it lower because the quality is too grainy.', '2004-09-30 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(932166, 108603, 25464, '<td valign="top">This was an excellent idea with problems in execution.  The background is the downfall.  The wrinkled sheet is terrible.  I would have considered a black background and direct backlight as the main light source.  Very creative though.</td>', 'This was an excellent idea with problems in execution.  The background is the downfall.  The wrinkled sheet is terrible.  I would have considered a black background and direct backlight as the main light source.  Very creative though.', '2004-09-30 01:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(932167, 108164, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the composition, lighting, and background.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the composition, lighting, and background.', '2004-09-30 01:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(932169, 108568, 26362, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept... where would someone find moon cake shaped like this? It jumped out at me, so I have to rate it higher! Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting concept... where would someone find moon cake shaped like this? It jumped out at me, so I have to rate it higher! Good luck!', '2004-09-30 01:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(932171, 107899, 26362, '<td valign="top">It strikes me more as traditional still-life photography, and less as a wacky portrayal of the pears</td>', 'It strikes me more as traditional still-life photography, and less as a wacky portrayal of the pears', '2004-09-30 01:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(932173, 108556, 26362, '<td valign="top">While the shot itself is clear and crisp and gets the "wacky" message across, I took the vote down a few notches for creativity. The gag is a bit overdone... but this pic may have promise compared to the other submissions... gave it a 6</td>', 'While the shot itself is clear and crisp and gets the "wacky" message across, I took the vote down a few notches for creativity. The gag is a bit overdone... but this pic may have promise compared to the other submissions... gave it a 6', '2004-09-30 01:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(932174, 108587, 26362, '<td valign="top">I find the background distracting, and the picture not so wacky. Cute, but not a lot of effort on the wacky end.</td>', 'I find the background distracting, and the picture not so wacky. Cute, but not a lot of effort on the wacky end.', '2004-09-30 01:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(932177, 107536, 26362, '<td valign="top">See, now without the title, I wouldn''t have understood the concept here. Have to make it down a few because of that. To me, it looks like a normal breakfast or brunch.</td>', 'See, now without the title, I wouldn''t have understood the concept here. Have to make it down a few because of that. To me, it looks like a normal breakfast or brunch.', '2004-09-30 01:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(932179, 108390, 25355, '<td valign="top">out of focus, uninteresting</td>', 'out of focus, uninteresting', '2004-09-30 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(932180, 108588, 26362, '<td valign="top">Gag is overdone in my opinion. It''s just not as creative as some of the other submissions.</td>', 'Gag is overdone in my opinion. It''s just not as creative as some of the other submissions.', '2004-09-30 01:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(932182, 108442, 25355, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t show any food, except maybe a few crumbs ... so, what did they eat?</td>', 'it doesn''t show any food, except maybe a few crumbs ... so, what did they eat?', '2004-09-30 01:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(932183, 108286, 26362, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''ve seen too many ____ sandwiches in this competition. I think the plastic-ness of the crocodile detracts from the picture here.</td>', 'Maybe I''ve seen too many ____ sandwiches in this competition. I think the plastic-ness of the crocodile detracts from the picture here.', '2004-09-30 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(932185, 108392, 25355, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting, sorry.</td>', 'Not very interesting, sorry.', '2004-09-30 01:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(932186, 108604, 26362, '<td valign="top">Pretty and tasty... I get it. It''s at least more creative than a lot I''ve seen for "wacky..." I''m giving it a 5</td>', 'Pretty and tasty... I get it. It''s at least more creative than a lot I''ve seen for "wacky..." I''m giving it a 5', '2004-09-30 01:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(932187, 108274, 25355, '<td valign="top">Is it genetically modified? It''s very hard to tell that it''s a food, though it does have an avocado-ish shape.</td>', 'Is it genetically modified? It''s very hard to tell that it''s a food, though it does have an avocado-ish shape.', '2004-09-30 01:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(932188, 107257, 26362, '<td valign="top">Oooh another apple... I can feel the tension here :) I think the concept would have been more dramatic if the spikes were all over the surface... but I still scored it higher than most I''ve seen!</td>', 'Oooh another apple... I can feel the tension here :) I think the concept would have been more dramatic if the spikes were all over the surface... but I still scored it higher than most I''ve seen!', '2004-09-30 01:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(932189, 108435, 25355, '<td valign="top">poor focus, strange idea ... do you mean the banana is going bananas?</td>', 'poor focus, strange idea ... do you mean the banana is going bananas?', '2004-09-30 01:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(932191, 108433, 25355, '<td valign="top">I love the arrangement of the "teeth" - a kind of goofy grin.</td>', 'I love the arrangement of the "teeth" - a kind of goofy grin.', '2004-09-30 01:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(932193, 108594, 26362, '<td valign="top">I don''t know... I''m on the border with this one. I actually wouldn''t have put this in a wacky category on it''s own. Most people skimming over it could mistake it as a flower, which isn''t wacky to me.</td>', 'I don''t know... I''m on the border with this one. I actually wouldn''t have put this in a wacky category on it''s own. Most people skimming over it could mistake it as a flower, which isn''t wacky to me.', '2004-09-30 01:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(932194, 108598, 26362, '<td valign="top">The little design on the (tabletop? tablecloth?) is distracting to me, and I think the one spot of catsup looks out of place in the composition. Still more creative than a lot I''ve seen on here, good work</td>', 'The little design on the (tabletop? tablecloth?) is distracting to me, and I think the one spot of catsup looks out of place in the composition. Still more creative than a lot I''ve seen on here, good work', '2004-09-30 01:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(932196, 108307, 26362, '<td valign="top">Finally, something with a little creative flare! I like this a lot, it''s my top ranked as of now! oooh the suspense :)</td>', 'Finally, something with a little creative flare! I like this a lot, it''s my top ranked as of now! oooh the suspense :)', '2004-09-30 01:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
