(933291, 108504, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, I wonder if this is by one of our Islandic friends. When I visited,  I remember seeing enormous drying racks of fish and thinking "what a great idea!"  Anyhow, a good idea for the Challenge.  Probably would have been helpful to have the background even more blurred as it does have a tendency to distract...</td>', 'Oh, I wonder if this is by one of our Islandic friends. When I visited,  I remember seeing enormous drying racks of fish and thinking "what a great idea!"  Anyhow, a good idea for the Challenge.  Probably would have been helpful to have the background even more blurred as it does have a tendency to distract...', '2004-09-30 21:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(933292, 108513, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Maybe it would also be fun to zero in on one of those very nice compositions and try to make it ''pop!''  Still, a good take on the Challenge.</td>', 'Great idea.  Maybe it would also be fun to zero in on one of those very nice compositions and try to make it ''pop!''  Still, a good take on the Challenge.', '2004-09-30 21:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(933293, 108372, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yep, they are not bad.  Of course a cocktail or two helps the taste buds in this case...  Cute take on the Challenge.  My compliments to your model!</td>', 'Yep, they are not bad.  Of course a cocktail or two helps the taste buds in this case...  Cute take on the Challenge.  My compliments to your model!', '2004-09-30 21:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(933296, 107518, 14476, '<td valign="top">Jeepers!  Are you sure this is a cucumber?  Looks like an alien from who know where.   Clever take on the challenge.  Could probably be in stronger focus.  The shadow is a bit strong.  Maybe better lighting would have eliminated the shadow, "or" since the shadow looks something like a profile, think about zeroing in on it and making it a strong part of the composition.   I do like your original take on the Challenge.</td>', 'Jeepers!  Are you sure this is a cucumber?  Looks like an alien from who know where.   Clever take on the challenge.  Could probably be in stronger focus.  The shadow is a bit strong.  Maybe better lighting would have eliminated the shadow, "or" since the shadow looks something like a profile, think about zeroing in on it and making it a strong part of the composition.   I do like your original take on the Challenge.', '2004-09-30 21:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(933297, 108398, 14476, '<td valign="top">But onions are good food!  Nicely photographed, though...</td>', 'But onions are good food!  Nicely photographed, though...', '2004-09-30 21:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(933301, 108286, 14476, '<td valign="top">Haaa, ha.  Cute!  Loved your idea!  Wish whatever that background object is (his swamp?) wasn''t there, um, yes, the knife could go too. But, more important, really, really super idea.</td>', 'Haaa, ha.  Cute!  Loved your idea!  Wish whatever that background object is (his swamp?) wasn''t there, um, yes, the knife could go too. But, more important, really, really super idea.', '2004-09-30 21:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
