(933400, 108193, 10720, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, love the idea and everything in it is perfect. My guess it is done by one of our "Master" contestants :-)</td>', 'This is a great shot, love the idea and everything in it is perfect. My guess it is done by one of our "Master" contestants :-)', '2004-10-01 00:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
