(934158, 108577, 26741, '<td valign="top">I think this is cute and quite clear, but I voted it lower because I don''t really feel that it meets the challenge parameters.  I''m not sure putting a cute kitten in a chinese takeout box qualifies him as food...</td>', 'I think this is cute and quite clear, but I voted it lower because I don''t really feel that it meets the challenge parameters.  I''m not sure putting a cute kitten in a chinese takeout box qualifies him as food...', '2004-10-01 09:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(934230, 107962, 11940, '<td valign="top">Love the lightning technique</td>', 'Love the lightning technique', '2004-10-01 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934442, 108523, 24495, '<td valign="top">I can almost ''touch'' the sugar on the cake!</td>', 'I can almost ''touch'' the sugar on the cake!', '2004-10-01 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(934525, 108413, 24495, '<td valign="top">Good Idea.</td>', 'Good Idea.', '2004-10-01 13:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(934610, 108535, 27178, '<td valign="top">The lighting needs some work - doesn''t give the image enough punch. Other than that, I like the composition of the image although I would have preferred that it wasn''t cropped as tight on the top of the image. I wouldn''t want this for dinner</td>', 'The lighting needs some work - doesn''t give the image enough punch. Other than that, I like the composition of the image although I would have preferred that it wasn''t cropped as tight on the top of the image. I wouldn''t want this for dinner', '2004-10-01 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934634, 108180, 27178, '<td valign="top">This looks like it took some time, cool concept.<br/> <br/>I would have preferred it lit from the front instead of the back and side. Also, the peel has portions at the top front of the image that are out of the focal plane which become somewhat distracting. I do like the POV though.</td>', 'This looks like it took some time, cool concept. I would have preferred it lit from the front instead of the back and side. Also, the peel has portions at the top front of the image that are out of the focal plane which become somewhat distracting. I do like the POV though.', '2004-10-01 13:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(934641, 108492, 27178, '<td valign="top">The backlighting and presentation are excellent - I really like how this image came out.<br/> <br/>Is it wacky food? hmmm.</td>', 'The backlighting and presentation are excellent - I really like how this image came out. Is it wacky food? hmmm.', '2004-10-01 13:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(934658, 107104, 27178, '<td valign="top">Bands on the claws make this wacky for me  *grin*<br/> <br/>The lighting doesn''t really bring out the brilliant red of the cooked crawfish but it is an interesting POV the way the image is framed.</td>', 'Bands on the claws make this wacky for me  *grin* The lighting doesn''t really bring out the brilliant red of the cooked crawfish but it is an interesting POV the way the image is framed.', '2004-10-01 13:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934667, 108527, 27178, '<td valign="top">Wacky and fun. The focus is a little soft but I like the image overall.</td>', 'Wacky and fun. The focus is a little soft but I like the image overall.', '2004-10-01 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(934698, 108525, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is definately wacky food, but the photo is lacking, I feel.  The composition could be better, a little more artsy-fartsy, you know.  <br/> <br/>So, if need be, can I call on you to make a wedding cake for me?</td>', 'This is definately wacky food, but the photo is lacking, I feel.  The composition could be better, a little more artsy-fartsy, you know.   So, if need be, can I call on you to make a wedding cake for me?', '2004-10-01 14:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(934734, 107375, 3799, '<td valign="top">a less distracting plate would of made a big difference in this image</td>', 'a less distracting plate would of made a big difference in this image', '2004-10-01 14:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(934756, 107597, 18868, '<td valign="top">I get the gag, but only because I recognized the golf tee.  The golf club is far too out of focus.  If you use the zoom at maximum and place the camera further back, you will get a greater depth of focus.</td>', 'I get the gag, but only because I recognized the golf tee.  The golf club is far too out of focus.  If you use the zoom at maximum and place the camera further back, you will get a greater depth of focus.', '2004-10-01 14:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934806, 107738, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very good idea marred by poor execution.  A tripod, less exposure, setting the white balance will improve this image.</td>', 'Very good idea marred by poor execution.  A tripod, less exposure, setting the white balance will improve this image.', '2004-10-01 14:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(934814, 107478, 18868, '<td valign="top">Outstanding idea!  The flash is quite harsh -- try bouncing off a white card or using a difuser such as a sheet of tissue to soften the light.</td>', 'Outstanding idea!  The flash is quite harsh -- try bouncing off a white card or using a difuser such as a sheet of tissue to soften the light.', '2004-10-01 14:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(934826, 108363, 18868, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Slight lack of whacky-ness.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Slight lack of whacky-ness.', '2004-10-01 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(935126, 107476, 22538, '<td valign="top">Will you post a recipe as well. please?</td>', 'Will you post a recipe as well. please?', '2004-10-01 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(935237, 108603, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  A shallow DOF would help to blur the background.  It would have helped to have another method to light the background.  Still good though but could have been much better.</td>', 'Great idea!  A shallow DOF would help to blur the background.  It would have helped to have another method to light the background.  Still good though but could have been much better.', '2004-10-01 17:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
