(936164, 108603, 25921, '<td valign="top">PETA to the rescue!!!!!  Great expression on the fish, kinda says "Oh #%#!"  My only complaint would be the composition.  I think undue attention is drawn to the glass with the strawberry and the blue straw.  Also, this glass is in shadow.  Unfortunately, my eye is consistently drawn to the lower left corner, when the part of the picture that shines the most is on the other side of the photo.  Great effort.</td>', 'PETA to the rescue!!!!!  Great expression on the fish, kinda says "Oh #%#!"  My only complaint would be the composition.  I think undue attention is drawn to the glass with the strawberry and the blue straw.  Also, this glass is in shadow.  Unfortunately, my eye is consistently drawn to the lower left corner, when the part of the picture that shines the most is on the other side of the photo.  Great effort.', '2004-10-02 02:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(936165, 107392, 24076, '<td valign="top">Nice color and focus and lighting...one of the few food shots I''ve seen so far that accomplished that.</td>', 'Nice color and focus and lighting...one of the few food shots I''ve seen so far that accomplished that.', '2004-10-02 02:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(936166, 107469, 25921, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I had a similar idea to deconstruct a big mac and photograph it.  I was thinking of calling it a "The Anticommercial".  But unfortunately, I think a picture of the anatomy of a big mac would make a damn ugly photo.  Ha.  The background of this picture is distracting, but I love the compostion otherwise.  Especially the low key McDonald''s cup, and the way the fries are splayed out to the viewer.  Good job<br/></td>', 'Excellent shot.  I had a similar idea to deconstruct a big mac and photograph it.  I was thinking of calling it a "The Anticommercial".  But unfortunately, I think a picture of the anatomy of a big mac would make a damn ugly photo.  Ha.  The background of this picture is distracting, but I love the compostion otherwise.  Especially the low key McDonald''s cup, and the way the fries are splayed out to the viewer.  Good job', '2004-10-02 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
