(936733, 108535, 26695, '<td valign="top">Funny pic but too much shadow.. olives get lost in it, bananas in back seem out of focus. Clever idea.</td>', 'Funny pic but too much shadow.. olives get lost in it, bananas in back seem out of focus. Clever idea.', '2004-10-02 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(936734, 108398, 26757, '<td valign="top">Good idea, with potential, but you need to take the time to reshoot this one...  Be careful to compensate for the highlight, then you can dodge out the shadows if you need to, once the highlights are blown out, there is little that you can do.  Also, check your film speed, as this came out awfully grainy...   Might want to try shooting this at asa 100 and uping the shutter speed... <br/>ginette</td>', 'Good idea, with potential, but you need to take the time to reshoot this one...  Be careful to compensate for the highlight, then you can dodge out the shadows if you need to, once the highlights are blown out, there is little that you can do.  Also, check your film speed, as this came out awfully grainy...   Might want to try shooting this at asa 100 and uping the shutter speed... ginette', '2004-10-02 11:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(936737, 107841, 26695, '<td valign="top">Too much shadow in some places, too much light in others. Out of focus enough that I can''t tell what some of it is.</td>', 'Too much shadow in some places, too much light in others. Out of focus enough that I can''t tell what some of it is.', '2004-10-02 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(936738, 107257, 25218, '<td valign="top">very funny, and great color!</td>', 'very funny, and great color!', '2004-10-02 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(936741, 108571, 25218, '<td valign="top">cute, but a little soft</td>', 'cute, but a little soft', '2004-10-02 11:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(936742, 108188, 26695, '<td valign="top">Looks like there''s a hair going across the front of the fruit. Otherwise nice color.</td>', 'Looks like there''s a hair going across the front of the fruit. Otherwise nice color.', '2004-10-02 11:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(936744, 107013, 26757, '<td valign="top">Very nice... but a little too high contrast....  You lost all detail in the shadows, and in the blown out highlights...  Really worth a reshoot.<br/>ginette</td>', 'Very nice... but a little too high contrast....  You lost all detail in the shadows, and in the blown out highlights...  Really worth a reshoot.ginette', '2004-10-02 11:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936745, 107841, 25218, '<td valign="top">It''s too out of focus</td>', 'It''s too out of focus', '2004-10-02 11:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(936746, 108560, 26695, '<td valign="top">Very clever, I like the simplicity and color!</td>', 'Very clever, I like the simplicity and color!', '2004-10-02 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(936747, 107899, 25218, '<td valign="top">too blurry - is the resolution too small? it looks pixelated</td>', 'too blurry - is the resolution too small? it looks pixelated', '2004-10-02 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(936748, 107319, 26695, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2004-10-02 11:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(936754, 108444, 25218, '<td valign="top">the white balance is off, and I''ve seen this composition before... on The Price Is Right</td>', 'the white balance is off, and I''ve seen this composition before... on The Price Is Right', '2004-10-02 11:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(936755, 107257, 26695, '<td valign="top">Very clever and funny.. Love it.</td>', 'Very clever and funny.. Love it.', '2004-10-02 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936758, 108598, 25218, '<td valign="top">the little flower in the upper left is distracting.</td>', 'the little flower in the upper left is distracting.', '2004-10-02 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(936761, 108565, 25218, '<td valign="top">I eat these all the time!</td>', 'I eat these all the time!', '2004-10-02 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(936762, 108506, 26757, '<td valign="top">Simply too busy....<br/>ginette</td>', 'Simply too busy....ginette', '2004-10-02 12:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(936763, 107962, 26695, '<td valign="top">Terrific color and composition!</td>', 'Terrific color and composition!', '2004-10-02 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(936766, 108327, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like it, but there''s too many distracting things in the background: the pasta house, the electric outlet, the black vent(?), etc.</td>', 'I like it, but there''s too many distracting things in the background: the pasta house, the electric outlet, the black vent(?), etc.', '2004-10-02 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(936767, 108366, 26695, '<td valign="top">I don''t like gummy candies or sushi but very clever. Love the bursts of color.</td>', 'I don''t like gummy candies or sushi but very clever. Love the bursts of color.', '2004-10-02 12:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(936769, 108527, 25218, '<td valign="top">cute idea. It''s just a touch out of focus and a bit overexposed.</td>', 'cute idea. It''s just a touch out of focus and a bit overexposed.', '2004-10-02 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(936771, 108317, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice execution of a clever idea. Don''t care for the candles, though - they are overwhelmed and not needed, I think.</td>', 'Nice execution of a clever idea. Don''t care for the candles, though - they are overwhelmed and not needed, I think.', '2004-10-02 12:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(936773, 107631, 25218, '<td valign="top">I think the folds &amp; the overlapping napkins detract from the photo. But I like the b/w &amp; the shadow. Good idea!</td>', 'I think the folds & the overlapping napkins detract from the photo. But I like the b/w & the shadow. Good idea!', '2004-10-02 12:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936777, 108603, 25218, '<td valign="top">funny, but sick! I think getting rid of the motor part of the blender would have been better.</td>', 'funny, but sick! I think getting rid of the motor part of the blender would have been better.', '2004-10-02 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(936779, 108567, 25218, '<td valign="top">very elaborate! looks good,.</td>', 'very elaborate! looks good,.', '2004-10-02 12:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(936783, 108284, 25218, '<td valign="top">Did they have strawberries in Illyria? Great idea with good composition.</td>', 'Did they have strawberries in Illyria? Great idea with good composition.', '2004-10-02 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(936784, 107970, 25218, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot</td>', 'Great macro shot', '2004-10-02 12:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(936789, 108592, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the overall idea of this shot. I feel you should crop so the food isn''t dead center of the image. The photo underneath of the spider web would be more dramatic with it being black and not grey in between the webs. - 7</td>', 'I like the overall idea of this shot. I feel you should crop so the food isn''t dead center of the image. The photo underneath of the spider web would be more dramatic with it being black and not grey in between the webs. - 7', '2004-10-02 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(936793, 107496, 4493, '<td valign="top">Overall good concept and execution. I know you wanted a high key effect here and it looks good. I think that there may no be enough mouth showing, and that''s why it feels out of balance to me. - 7</td>', 'Overall good concept and execution. I know you wanted a high key effect here and it looks good. I think that there may no be enough mouth showing, and that''s why it feels out of balance to me. - 7', '2004-10-02 12:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(936795, 108239, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice studio shot. Nothing overwhelming here. I don''t think the centered composition works for this shot, especially with the shadow falling to the left. I think more space on the left for the shadow would make a more balanced composition. I also think your exclusion of the top of the gord weakens the composition. - 7</td>', 'Nice studio shot. Nothing overwhelming here. I don''t think the centered composition works for this shot, especially with the shadow falling to the left. I think more space on the left for the shadow would make a more balanced composition. I also think your exclusion of the top of the gord weakens the composition. - 7', '2004-10-02 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(936797, 107644, 4493, '<td valign="top">Unique concept. The placement of the fish in the nest is a whacky location, but fish in itself, not so whacky. You have exposed this shot perfectly and the centered composition works nicely. Bump to an 8.</td>', 'Unique concept. The placement of the fish in the nest is a whacky location, but fish in itself, not so whacky. You have exposed this shot perfectly and the centered composition works nicely. Bump to an 8.', '2004-10-02 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(936803, 108363, 4493, '<td valign="top">Mainstay of southern cooking. Not so whacky down here. Overall good exposure. Composition isn''t overly interesting and the lighting doesn''t add anything dramatic to the image. - 6</td>', 'Mainstay of southern cooking. Not so whacky down here. Overall good exposure. Composition isn''t overly interesting and the lighting doesn''t add anything dramatic to the image. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(936807, 108539, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light shot. Unfortunately I can''t make out what the food is on the plate. Composition isn''t too bad, maybe too many items in the shot. Sometimes less is more. - 6</td>', 'Nice natural light shot. Unfortunately I can''t make out what the food is on the plate. Composition isn''t too bad, maybe too many items in the shot. Sometimes less is more. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(936812, 108556, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure on this shot. The composition is weak. I think that you''ve included too much space at the bottom that doesn''t add to your shot. The reflection, although nice, isn''t strong enough to justify its inclusion. You also have a tilt in your horizon, not enough to be ''artistic'', but too much to seem on purpose. - 6</td>', 'Perfect exposure on this shot. The composition is weak. I think that you''ve included too much space at the bottom that doesn''t add to your shot. The reflection, although nice, isn''t strong enough to justify its inclusion. You also have a tilt in your horizon, not enough to be ''artistic'', but too much to seem on purpose. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(936815, 108502, 4493, '<td valign="top">Silly<br/> <br/>Good attempt at a studio shot. The lighting seems decent enough, but may be a little flat. The blacks in this shot seem more gray. Perhaps adjust your levels to bring down your tones some to add more contrast to the shot. - 6</td>', 'Silly Good attempt at a studio shot. The lighting seems decent enough, but may be a little flat. The blacks in this shot seem more gray. Perhaps adjust your levels to bring down your tones some to add more contrast to the shot. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(936818, 107392, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination.<br/> <br/>Technically, good colors, but you have blown some of the highlights on the ice cream. I also feel that too much sharpening has been done in post processing. Overall composition is fine. - 6</td>', 'Interesting combination. Technically, good colors, but you have blown some of the highlights on the ice cream. I also feel that too much sharpening has been done in post processing. Overall composition is fine. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(936825, 107962, 4493, '<td valign="top">Triangulation of composition is always strong. Yours works nicely. I do however feel the overall shot is soft in focus. This is perhaps due to a wide aperture. I would think if you''re wanting to include items farther back in the shot, you''d want to close down the aperture, lengthen your shutter time and use a tripod to get the image as sharp as possible. - 6</td>', 'Triangulation of composition is always strong. Yours works nicely. I do however feel the overall shot is soft in focus. This is perhaps due to a wide aperture. I would think if you''re wanting to include items farther back in the shot, you''d want to close down the aperture, lengthen your shutter time and use a tripod to get the image as sharp as possible. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(936829, 108086, 4493, '<td valign="top">Yes this is a closeup of a scorpion, but the setting does not imply ''dessert''. Overall focus is soft and the lighting a little harsh. - 6</td>', 'Yes this is a closeup of a scorpion, but the setting does not imply ''dessert''. Overall focus is soft and the lighting a little harsh. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(936832, 108413, 4493, '<td valign="top">Cute. You may want to try a crop with the fruit in upper right giving it more negative space to fly into. Lighting is good and the overall effect of it flying is believable. - 6</td>', 'Cute. You may want to try a crop with the fruit in upper right giving it more negative space to fly into. Lighting is good and the overall effect of it flying is believable. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(936837, 108215, 4493, '<td valign="top">I see you''re trying to get a ''studio'' feel to the shot. The lone star on the blue cloth tightly cropped in doesn''t bring the viewer in. Your composition should want to make the viewer want to eat this fruit, but as it is, it seems out of place. Try including some items or a whole fruit in the shot as well to balance out what we''re seeing. - 6</td>', 'I see you''re trying to get a ''studio'' feel to the shot. The lone star on the blue cloth tightly cropped in doesn''t bring the viewer in. Your composition should want to make the viewer want to eat this fruit, but as it is, it seems out of place. Try including some items or a whole fruit in the shot as well to balance out what we''re seeing. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(936841, 107798, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very well done studio shot. May be a bit hot under the plate drawing my eye away from the sandwiches, but overall nice. The composition is strong and compliments the idea. It''s hard to make out that these are gummie bears though. Did you try adding one or two on the plate to bring the idea across more? Good shot. - 6</td>', 'Very well done studio shot. May be a bit hot under the plate drawing my eye away from the sandwiches, but overall nice. The composition is strong and compliments the idea. It''s hard to make out that these are gummie bears though. Did you try adding one or two on the plate to bring the idea across more? Good shot. - 6', '2004-10-02 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936852, 107257, 4493, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Your cropping is a little tight on the right and there may be some motion blur. The shot isn''t bad, it just may need a different crop or some fill light on the right. - 6</td>', 'This made me smile. Your cropping is a little tight on the right and there may be some motion blur. The shot isn''t bad, it just may need a different crop or some fill light on the right. - 6', '2004-10-02 13:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(936858, 107813, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and executed pretty well. I think you have included a little too much negative space on the left and the highlights on the top of the can are a little strong. The colors are good and the image is sharp. I know I''m not the first to mention the fingernail... little things can make or break a shot. - 6</td>', 'Interesting idea, and executed pretty well. I think you have included a little too much negative space on the left and the highlights on the top of the can are a little strong. The colors are good and the image is sharp. I know I''m not the first to mention the fingernail... little things can make or break a shot. - 6', '2004-10-02 13:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(936865, 108603, 4493, '<td valign="top">Less is more. I think you just needed to include the blender jar with the contents to make this statement. Your sheet in the background should be ironed or purposefully folded and wrinkled to break up the background. The light is hot, but you did well in trying to backlight the jar so as to minimize the reflection. - 6</td>', 'Less is more. I think you just needed to include the blender jar with the contents to make this statement. Your sheet in the background should be ironed or purposefully folded and wrinkled to break up the background. The light is hot, but you did well in trying to backlight the jar so as to minimize the reflection. - 6', '2004-10-02 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936956, 107897, 7252, '<td valign="top">This shot actually fits the challenge much better than some of the other photos. The quality just isn''t there. If you correct for the color cast from the wrong white balance it improves quite a bit. It looks like it was shot at a restaurant so there was no real control of the lighting but if you could have used a polarizer it may have negated the harsh glare. I''m not sure if it''s motion blur or lack of focus but it needs to be much sharper. A more overhead angle so your subject is parallel to the sensor would also be nice.</td>', 'This shot actually fits the challenge much better than some of the other photos. The quality just isn''t there. If you correct for the color cast from the wrong white balance it improves quite a bit. It looks like it was shot at a restaurant so there was no real control of the lighting but if you could have used a polarizer it may have negated the harsh glare. I''m not sure if it''s motion blur or lack of focus but it needs to be much sharper. A more overhead angle so your subject is parallel to the sensor would also be nice.', '2004-10-02 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(936961, 107275, 7252, '<td valign="top">While not particularly wacky (seems like a pregnancy treat) this is the best photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge.</td>', 'While not particularly wacky (seems like a pregnancy treat) this is the best photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge.', '2004-10-02 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(936983, 108327, 27524, '<td valign="top">Hehe :) good humour. Still seems you made border after croping so few main parts of picture are cutted now. Well and few things at bacground are distracting too. But ligh of fire is real nice.</td>', 'Hehe :) good humour. Still seems you made border after croping so few main parts of picture are cutted now. Well and few things at bacground are distracting too. But ligh of fire is real nice.', '2004-10-02 14:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(937006, 108443, 27524, '<td valign="top">Could be more on focus. If you make these plums more shiney would get better reflection on eyes. Some distraction spots on his face...but i guess you couldnt replace that vedgetable.</td>', 'Could be more on focus. If you make these plums more shiney would get better reflection on eyes. Some distraction spots on his face...but i guess you couldnt replace that vedgetable.', '2004-10-02 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(937014, 108216, 27524, '<td valign="top">Uh apple with broken heart. I guess its not paint but some jam or juice...makes it even tasty :) strange. After all good lights and focus.</td>', 'Uh apple with broken heart. I guess its not paint but some jam or juice...makes it even tasty :) strange. After all good lights and focus.', '2004-10-02 14:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(937026, 107476, 27524, '<td valign="top">Uh thats not tasty... looks like brain even if some eat it...<br/>Focus is too close on rise... would like more light on plate too.</td>', 'Uh thats not tasty... looks like brain even if some eat it...Focus is too close on rise... would like more light on plate too.', '2004-10-02 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(937029, 108127, 27524, '<td valign="top">Could place it more tigheter on plate or less things to put them in center. Would like more light...and wet salad doesnt look appealing. Orange color on these fornt ''things'' are interesting.</td>', 'Could place it more tigheter on plate or less things to put them in center. Would like more light...and wet salad doesnt look appealing. Orange color on these fornt ''things'' are interesting.', '2004-10-02 14:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(937030, 108171, 27524, '<td valign="top">Hmm...nothing wacky or odd... Would look nicer if they are placed in center and more light to apples.</td>', 'Hmm...nothing wacky or odd... Would look nicer if they are placed in center and more light to apples.', '2004-10-02 15:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(937031, 108450, 20056, '<td valign="top">the light is too hard...</td>', 'the light is too hard...', '2004-10-02 15:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(937033, 108590, 20056, '<td valign="top">the green is a little too much for me...</td>', 'the green is a little too much for me...', '2004-10-02 15:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(937034, 108432, 20056, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much....</td>', 'I like this picture very much....', '2004-10-02 15:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(937035, 108179, 27524, '<td valign="top">Doesnt look strange combination. Wheels looks interesting...garlic too... paprica need focus... but looks like grass just fell on :) pretty distracting.</td>', 'Doesnt look strange combination. Wheels looks interesting...garlic too... paprica need focus... but looks like grass just fell on :) pretty distracting.', '2004-10-02 15:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(937036, 108366, 20056, '<td valign="top">too much people around... :)</td>', 'too much people around... :)', '2004-10-02 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(937038, 107644, 27524, '<td valign="top">Is that birds nest? Dont think we eat it but together looks interesting. Color of fish is real good. Still would like nest beeing less messy on few corners...would make better compozition. Good luck!</td>', 'Is that birds nest? Dont think we eat it but together looks interesting. Color of fish is real good. Still would like nest beeing less messy on few corners...would make better compozition. Good luck!', '2004-10-02 15:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(937043, 108600, 20056, '<td valign="top">Sorry not tasty photograph for me...</td>', 'Sorry not tasty photograph for me...', '2004-10-02 15:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(937047, 107600, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) I would say it more like traditional combination. I like soft focus on girl...and reflecting on fork...on spoon its messed but i guess its been used for eathing sames as peaces of strawberry on her belly. Pitty that berry could have bit more fresh look.</td>', ':) I would say it more like traditional combination. I like soft focus on girl...and reflecting on fork...on spoon its messed but i guess its been used for eathing sames as peaces of strawberry on her belly. Pitty that berry could have bit more fresh look.', '2004-10-02 15:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(937051, 108324, 20056, '<td valign="top">white is distracting...</td>', 'white is distracting...', '2004-10-02 15:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(937053, 107600, 20056, '<td valign="top">the strawberry seems in the air... otherwise a 10</td>', 'the strawberry seems in the air... otherwise a 10', '2004-10-02 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(937056, 108581, 27524, '<td valign="top">Ok thats wacky...and he is looking on me uhh. Too many distracting things around but crab looks interesting.</td>', 'Ok thats wacky...and he is looking on me uhh. Too many distracting things around but crab looks interesting.', '2004-10-02 15:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(937058, 107813, 20056, '<td valign="top">:) nice colors</td>', ':) nice colors', '2004-10-02 15:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937060, 108516, 20056, '<td valign="top">Really, do You eat that? nice picture</td>', 'Really, do You eat that? nice picture', '2004-10-02 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(937061, 107882, 27524, '<td valign="top">Looks like just normal desert. Hey these berries are real interesting in suit. If you putted just them together in middle + zoom, i think it would be real good shot.</td>', 'Looks like just normal desert. Hey these berries are real interesting in suit. If you putted just them together in middle + zoom, i think it would be real good shot.', '2004-10-02 15:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(937062, 107532, 20056, '<td valign="top">too hard light...</td>', 'too hard light...', '2004-10-02 15:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(937067, 107502, 27524, '<td valign="top">Interesting soft light...and idea is nice too. Just wall behind going away makes compozition out of place.</td>', 'Interesting soft light...and idea is nice too. Just wall behind going away makes compozition out of place.', '2004-10-02 15:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(937070, 107013, 20056, '<td valign="top">a little over exposed ?</td>', 'a little over exposed ?', '2004-10-02 15:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(937076, 108530, 20056, '<td valign="top">white too white</td>', 'white too white', '2004-10-02 15:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(937079, 108565, 27524, '<td valign="top">Good light and nice idea. Would take these left bananas and jars away, milk an paper holder bit behind so focus is on main food.</td>', 'Good light and nice idea. Would take these left bananas and jars away, milk an paper holder bit behind so focus is on main food.', '2004-10-02 15:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(937087, 107496, 27524, '<td valign="top">Yes some eat them but not alive i think. Exept that good picture.</td>', 'Yes some eat them but not alive i think. Exept that good picture.', '2004-10-02 15:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937093, 108398, 20056, '<td valign="top">Nice...but it is maybe the most common food in this planet after salt and water :)<br/></td>', 'Nice...but it is maybe the most common food in this planet after salt and water :)', '2004-10-02 15:37:26.000000', NULL, 1);
