(939916, 108215, 12151, '<td valign="top">The textures and colors and choice of lighting here are all magnificent.  Centering in this case was a nice choice.  The contrast and extreme detail within the meat of the fruit is captivating.  I''d really like to see a large, high-resolution version of this image.</td>', 'The textures and colors and choice of lighting here are all magnificent.  Centering in this case was a nice choice.  The contrast and extreme detail within the meat of the fruit is captivating.  I''d really like to see a large, high-resolution version of this image.', '2004-10-04 03:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
