(941308, 107913, 19608, '<td valign="top">The oils are perfect for this - great colors.  Your background, on the other hand, is much too distracting with the wrinkles.</td>', 'The oils are perfect for this - great colors.  Your background, on the other hand, is much too distracting with the wrinkles.', '2004-10-04 16:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
