(941343, 108306, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors are fantastic.  Overall the image has too much out of focus - which is a shame because the colors work so well.  The title is probablt true enough, but hard to swallow.</td>', 'The colors are fantastic.  Overall the image has too much out of focus - which is a shame because the colors work so well.  The title is probablt true enough, but hard to swallow.', '2004-10-04 17:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
