(941601, 108512, 24511, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, wacky idea, I can see good effort in creating this picture.  I would have liked to see "little/bigfoot" or should I say "sasquashitito".  Not enough background contrast for me.  I found the pixel quality poor.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Excellent composition, wacky idea, I can see good effort in creating this picture.  I would have liked to see "little/bigfoot" or should I say "sasquashitito".  Not enough background contrast for me.  I found the pixel quality poor.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-10-04 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941623, 108600, 27439, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to see this picture in focus. But it is a great idea :)</td>', 'I really wanted to see this picture in focus. But it is a great idea :)', '2004-10-04 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(941624, 107013, 24511, '<td valign="top">Pre-pear-ing to meet another photo challenge deadline?  Great play of light and shadow. Your tripod seems suspended in air as if it is travelling through time.  Since my family name is Poirier (french for pear tree), your photo immediately caught my attention.  The dark background leaves me with a sense of gloom for the future or for the past missed opportunities.  This contrast with the brightness of what can be controled in the hear and now...this very second.  Great talking piece that nails the challenge theme.  Thought I was looking at a 7 but turned out to be a 9 pointer.  Good job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-06 17:16:28.</i></td>', 'Pre-pear-ing to meet another photo challenge deadline?  Great play of light and shadow. Your tripod seems suspended in air as if it is travelling through time.  Since my family name is Poirier (french for pear tree), your photo immediately caught my attention.  The dark background leaves me with a sense of gloom for the future or for the past missed opportunities.  This contrast with the brightness of what can be controled in the hear and now...this very second.  Great talking piece that nails the challenge theme.  Thought I was looking at a 7 but turned out to be a 9 pointer.  Good job.', '2004-10-04 19:02:35.000000', '2004-10-06 18:16:28.000000', 1),
(941627, 107476, 27439, '<td valign="top">Mmm...yummy...or? Great coulurs and great perfomance!</td>', 'Mmm...yummy...or? Great coulurs and great perfomance!', '2004-10-04 19:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(941630, 107813, 27439, '<td valign="top">Great picture with great colours anf focus!</td>', 'Great picture with great colours anf focus!', '2004-10-04 19:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(941634, 107644, 27439, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more colours in this picture...but it´s a great idea! :)</td>', 'I would like to see more colours in this picture...but it´s a great idea! :)', '2004-10-04 19:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(941647, 108435, 24511, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a movie called the deep where a rig ballanced above a precipice under water.  Very unusual entry.  I don''t love it or hate it.  Let  me edge towards the higher end of the voting score for getting me stompted. 7</td>', 'Reminds me of a movie called the deep where a rig ballanced above a precipice under water.  Very unusual entry.  I don''t love it or hate it.  Let  me edge towards the higher end of the voting score for getting me stompted. 7', '2004-10-04 19:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(941659, 108598, 24511, '<td valign="top">Gross intestinal lost my appetite photo.  Kids must love this one.  Distracting floral patern and plain background needs creative facial.  High score for getting strong emotional response.  Great burping job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-06 17:24:34.</i></td>', 'Gross intestinal lost my appetite photo.  Kids must love this one.  Distracting floral patern and plain background needs creative facial.  High score for getting strong emotional response.  Great burping job.', '2004-10-04 19:16:18.000000', '2004-10-06 18:24:34.000000', 1),
(941666, 108444, 24511, '<td valign="top">I guess this is not wacky in Iceland.  Except for the language barrier, this could be a scene from my kitchen counter.  Lighting and pixel quality could use improvement.  Very international flavour.  Thanks a bunch.</td>', 'I guess this is not wacky in Iceland.  Except for the language barrier, this could be a scene from my kitchen counter.  Lighting and pixel quality could use improvement.  Very international flavour.  Thanks a bunch.', '2004-10-04 19:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(941671, 108527, 24511, '<td valign="top">Fantastic subject but lousy background.  With effort and immagination I would have given you a 9 or 10.  You know what they say in the photo world..."Don''t neglect your background."  I loved the subject.  Thanks.</td>', 'Fantastic subject but lousy background.  With effort and immagination I would have given you a 9 or 10.  You know what they say in the photo world..."Don''t neglect your background."  I loved the subject.  Thanks.', '2004-10-04 19:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(941677, 107649, 24511, '<td valign="top">You will never see me bite into this sandwich.  Excellent composition and picture quality.  The background seems pixel deficient.  I would have liked a complementary color as background.  You speared the toothpicks right through this challenge with ease.</td>', 'You will never see me bite into this sandwich.  Excellent composition and picture quality.  The background seems pixel deficient.  I would have liked a complementary color as background.  You speared the toothpicks right through this challenge with ease.', '2004-10-04 19:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(941692, 108565, 24511, '<td valign="top">Clarity, crisp focus, wowed me at first sight with the normalcy of wacky foods we know regular people eat.  I was distracted by the upper right corner line of bricks missing.  Drop of water on table lower right front a great discovery.  Big niner, great photo.</td>', 'Clarity, crisp focus, wowed me at first sight with the normalcy of wacky foods we know regular people eat.  I was distracted by the upper right corner line of bricks missing.  Drop of water on table lower right front a great discovery.  Big niner, great photo.', '2004-10-04 19:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(941736, 108362, 26361, '<td valign="top">Amusing  &amp; creative take on an old cliche. Great colors, idea and execution.</td>', 'Amusing  & creative take on an old cliche. Great colors, idea and execution.', '2004-10-04 19:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(941738, 108556, 26361, '<td valign="top">The negative space and reflection are a bit distracting to me, but this is an awesome shot.  Good job.</td>', 'The negative space and reflection are a bit distracting to me, but this is an awesome shot.  Good job.', '2004-10-04 20:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(941761, 108600, 22748, '<td valign="top">Definitely wacky. Yuck and wow all at the same time. :-P :-) :-{ :-]<br/> <br/>Could use a tiny bit more contrast maybe.</td>', 'Definitely wacky. Yuck and wow all at the same time. :-P :-) :-{ :-] Could use a tiny bit more contrast maybe.', '2004-10-04 20:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(941762, 108590, 22748, '<td valign="top">Jacko got ahold of a chocolate bar! Run away!!! :) This is cool, you can''t almost tell it it''s alive or not.</td>', 'Jacko got ahold of a chocolate bar! Run away!!! :) This is cool, you can''t almost tell it it''s alive or not.', '2004-10-04 20:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(941763, 107518, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great texture highlighted here. The shadow might be a tiny bit distracting though.</td>', 'Great texture highlighted here. The shadow might be a tiny bit distracting though.', '2004-10-04 20:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(941764, 108450, 22748, '<td valign="top">Mmmm... tasty. Only moderately high on the wackiness scale, but still a good photograph.</td>', 'Mmmm... tasty. Only moderately high on the wackiness scale, but still a good photograph.', '2004-10-04 20:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(941765, 108215, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting against a perfect background.  Not sure I like the brown (seed?)   Overall a very nice submission.</td>', 'Excellent lighting against a perfect background.  Not sure I like the brown (seed?)   Overall a very nice submission.', '2004-10-04 20:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(941766, 108603, 22748, '<td valign="top">OMG! *gasp*<br/> <br/>This is awesome! Someone is insanely creative. This is the first really great image I''ve seen in this challenge.<br/> <br/>10!</td>', 'OMG! *gasp* This is awesome! Someone is insanely creative. This is the first really great image I''ve seen in this challenge. 10!', '2004-10-04 20:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(941767, 108327, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nice perspective.</td>', 'Very cool. Nice perspective.', '2004-10-04 20:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941772, 107502, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great setup. Not great contrast though. It feels like the room is full of smoke or your lens is fogged up. I like the way the action figures feel in motion and alive though.</td>', 'Great setup. Not great contrast though. It feels like the room is full of smoke or your lens is fogged up. I like the way the action figures feel in motion and alive though.', '2004-10-04 20:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(941776, 108444, 22748, '<td valign="top">Could use a little better lighting. It''s a little uneven so some food such as the paprika are underexposed while others are pretty good. Also it feels a little on the yellowish side like maybe the white balance is a touch off. Interesting foods, but not terribly high on the wackiness scale, really.</td>', 'Could use a little better lighting. It''s a little uneven so some food such as the paprika are underexposed while others are pretty good. Also it feels a little on the yellowish side like maybe the white balance is a touch off. Interesting foods, but not terribly high on the wackiness scale, really.', '2004-10-04 20:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(941780, 108135, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Kinda wacky. But it feels like a flash flood!! Bad flash!! Or maybe just harsh direct lighting. Either way the textures and colors are really degraded by the lighting.</td>', 'Interesting. Kinda wacky. But it feels like a flash flood!! Bad flash!! Or maybe just harsh direct lighting. Either way the textures and colors are really degraded by the lighting.', '2004-10-04 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(941782, 107738, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Very creative.</td>', 'Great idea! Very creative.', '2004-10-04 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941785, 108409, 22748, '<td valign="top">Creative and very well executed! Sharp. Nice interesting but not too overwhelming background. This looks like something from a quality cookbook. "Wacky Foods" cookbook at least.</td>', 'Creative and very well executed! Sharp. Nice interesting but not too overwhelming background. This looks like something from a quality cookbook. "Wacky Foods" cookbook at least.', '2004-10-04 20:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(941786, 108506, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and arrangement of elements in the frame.</td>', 'Nice colors and arrangement of elements in the frame.', '2004-10-04 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(941790, 107944, 22748, '<td valign="top">Kinda needs some contrast boost, and it''s a bit grainy.</td>', 'Kinda needs some contrast boost, and it''s a bit grainy.', '2004-10-04 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(941791, 107476, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nice lighting, nice wackiness factor.</td>', 'Very cool. Nice lighting, nice wackiness factor.', '2004-10-04 20:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(941793, 107813, 22748, '<td valign="top">EEEEW!!!!! <br/> <br/>Very cool! So creative, so sharp. This is one of my favorites this challenge. Did you make the label yourself??</td>', 'EEEEW!!!!!  Very cool! So creative, so sharp. This is one of my favorites this challenge. Did you make the label yourself??', '2004-10-04 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(941797, 108381, 22748, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. Lots of creativity, but the camera angle is a little uninteresting IMO.  I would try getting lower, more on the level of the ''bunny''. Nice touch now the grass looks chewed-off. :)</td>', 'Pretty cool. Lots of creativity, but the camera angle is a little uninteresting IMO.  I would try getting lower, more on the level of the ''bunny''. Nice touch now the grass looks chewed-off. :)', '2004-10-04 20:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(941800, 108193, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous effort. Nice work on the box, it looks great. So creative!! 9</td>', 'Fabulous effort. Nice work on the box, it looks great. So creative!! 9', '2004-10-04 20:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(941802, 107913, 22748, '<td valign="top">The bottles are really nice looking but the background is distracting with its wrinkles and stuff.</td>', 'The bottles are really nice looking but the background is distracting with its wrinkles and stuff.', '2004-10-04 20:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(941810, 108516, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ewww.  You go first.  Unusual, but effective, take on the challenge.  The whitebackround works well but it merges with the plate in several spots.  Exposure seems to be right on.</td>', 'Ewww.  You go first.  Unusual, but effective, take on the challenge.  The whitebackround works well but it merges with the plate in several spots.  Exposure seems to be right on.', '2004-10-04 20:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(941812, 108289, 22748, '<td valign="top">And STINKY!!!! Those look like durian to me. My friend, who is Chinese, brought a durian to the office one time, and we all tried it. Takes ok, I kinda started to like it after the 3rd time I had one or so, but smells horrid. Like rotting flesh or something. I wonder where you took this picture? The writing looks like arabic or something middle eastern.<br/> <br/>Anyway, great picture of a REALLY wacky really real food. Most people don''t have any idea how weird and wacky this fruit really is. Another fun fact about durian: The trees are extremely dangerous to have around. If a durian falls on you, it could easily kill you. They weigh around 25 pounds or so, at least the ones I''ve had.</td>', 'And STINKY!!!! Those look like durian to me. My friend, who is Chinese, brought a durian to the office one time, and we all tried it. Takes ok, I kinda started to like it after the 3rd time I had one or so, but smells horrid. Like rotting flesh or something. I wonder where you took this picture? The writing looks like arabic or something middle eastern. Anyway, great picture of a REALLY wacky really real food. Most people don''t have any idea how weird and wacky this fruit really is. Another fun fact about durian: The trees are extremely dangerous to have around. If a durian falls on you, it could easily kill you. They weigh around 25 pounds or so, at least the ones I''ve had.', '2004-10-04 20:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(941815, 107469, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I like it. Nice sharp focus on the subject.</td>', 'Very creative. I like it. Nice sharp focus on the subject.', '2004-10-04 20:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(941818, 108525, 22748, '<td valign="top">LOL! That''s a great setup. The lighting''s a touch harsh. Nice photo though.</td>', 'LOL! That''s a great setup. The lighting''s a touch harsh. Nice photo though.', '2004-10-04 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(941819, 108603, 25397, '<td valign="top">I love it</td>', 'I love it', '2004-10-04 20:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(941820, 108288, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Good shot.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Good shot.', '2004-10-04 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(941823, 108598, 22748, '<td valign="top">Eeew. :-p  :)<br/> <br/>The lighting''s a little funky. Kind of a big shadow, it''s a little distracting. Also the little ''flower'' thing at the top-left and bottom-left is a little distracting from the otherwise nice clean background.</td>', 'Eeew. :-p  :) The lighting''s a little funky. Kind of a big shadow, it''s a little distracting. Also the little ''flower'' thing at the top-left and bottom-left is a little distracting from the otherwise nice clean background.', '2004-10-04 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
