(941837, 107025, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice. But -grrrrr- it makes me hungry for Indian food!!! :)<br/> <br/>It''s rather blurry though, and could use more contrast. Maybe some curves adjustment in Photoshop could fix that.</td>', 'Nice. But -grrrrr- it makes me hungry for Indian food!!! :) It''s rather blurry though, and could use more contrast. Maybe some curves adjustment in Photoshop could fix that.', '2004-10-04 20:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
