(942055, 107847, 19608, '<td valign="top">It actually looks delicious.  Good choice of background make the apple really stand out.  Perfect exposure.</td>', 'It actually looks delicious.  Good choice of background make the apple really stand out.  Perfect exposure.', '2004-10-04 23:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(942057, 108587, 19608, '<td valign="top">It certainaly is silly.  A darker background would help immensely.</td>', 'It certainaly is silly.  A darker background would help immensely.', '2004-10-04 23:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942059, 108525, 19608, '<td valign="top">Eww gross - but hilarious.  Thanks for the chuckle.</td>', 'Eww gross - but hilarious.  Thanks for the chuckle.', '2004-10-04 23:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942061, 108592, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great background - I assume it is a print that you placed the food on, good idea.  Exposure right on, interesting choice of wacky foods.</td>', 'Great background - I assume it is a print that you placed the food on, good idea.  Exposure right on, interesting choice of wacky foods.', '2004-10-04 23:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942065, 108503, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hey - that''s just escargot when you add a bit of butter.  Nice idea - colors seem a bit too saturated.</td>', 'Hey - that''s just escargot when you add a bit of butter.  Nice idea - colors seem a bit too saturated.', '2004-10-04 23:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(942067, 108577, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb rendering of a very cute kitty.  Exposure right on, great setup.</td>', 'Superb rendering of a very cute kitty.  Exposure right on, great setup.', '2004-10-04 23:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(942068, 108316, 24511, '<td valign="top">I just love this photo, period.  Initially I gave it a 9 after a quick scan of all thumbnails.  For days I would spot it somewhere on the edge of my screen.  Lets face it, popcorn invented the wacky in food.  The subject is fantastic.  The busy background adds interest but never steals the focal point and expression of the human popcorn popper.  The attraction to the girl just spins us immediately back to the corn flying in the foreground in her face and seemingly floating in a juggling pattern thanks to her open fingers and arm position.  Focus and framing is wowingly done.  10 and adding to my favorites collection.  Thanks.</td>', 'I just love this photo, period.  Initially I gave it a 9 after a quick scan of all thumbnails.  For days I would spot it somewhere on the edge of my screen.  Lets face it, popcorn invented the wacky in food.  The subject is fantastic.  The busy background adds interest but never steals the focal point and expression of the human popcorn popper.  The attraction to the girl just spins us immediately back to the corn flying in the foreground in her face and seemingly floating in a juggling pattern thanks to her open fingers and arm position.  Focus and framing is wowingly done.  10 and adding to my favorites collection.  Thanks.', '2004-10-04 23:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942075, 107597, 19608, '<td valign="top">The idea is a real winner.   Colors are perfect - composition on the diagonal is super.  You biggest problem is that the golf club takes up so much of the foreground and it''s not even close to in focus.  Many night not even grasp your point.  Perhaps a more recognizabele iron would have worked better.  But for sure, you needed to stop way down to hold more DoF.</td>', 'The idea is a real winner.   Colors are perfect - composition on the diagonal is super.  You biggest problem is that the golf club takes up so much of the foreground and it''s not even close to in focus.  Many night not even grasp your point.  Perhaps a more recognizabele iron would have worked better.  But for sure, you needed to stop way down to hold more DoF.', '2004-10-04 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(942076, 108392, 24511, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ash burnt can but I find the other challenge entries topped this image as whacky.  Good luck with your entry.</td>', 'Beautiful ash burnt can but I find the other challenge entries topped this image as whacky.  Good luck with your entry.', '2004-10-04 23:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(942082, 107970, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well done macro.  Colors are vibrant although you may would like a less focused light source to remove the many reflections.  A bit more diagonal would add some tension to the composition.</td>', 'Well done macro.  Colors are vibrant although you may would like a less focused light source to remove the many reflections.  A bit more diagonal would add some tension to the composition.', '2004-10-04 23:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(942084, 108413, 19608, '<td valign="top">hehe - well done.  The wings and feet really do look a bit real.  Perfect background.</td>', 'hehe - well done.  The wings and feet really do look a bit real.  Perfect background.', '2004-10-04 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942086, 108567, 19608, '<td valign="top">You went to a lot of work for this (or found a very convenient subject.)  Well exposed and composed.</td>', 'You went to a lot of work for this (or found a very convenient subject.)  Well exposed and composed.', '2004-10-04 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(942088, 108009, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not too wacky here in the US - it looks delicious!  Well setup, composed and exposed.  Colors are really vibrant.</td>', 'Not too wacky here in the US - it looks delicious!  Well setup, composed and exposed.  Colors are really vibrant.', '2004-10-04 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(942090, 108512, 19608, '<td valign="top">hehe - very cute and a great take on the challenge.  With all that white - your exposure is truly superb.</td>', 'hehe - very cute and a great take on the challenge.  With all that white - your exposure is truly superb.', '2004-10-04 23:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(942091, 107959, 17203, '<td valign="top">I was really surprised that more people didn''t go to Chinatown for this one. Good idea, sharpness and color. I think the business works against you on this one. Focusing on one cuttlefish/squid/whateveritis would have worked better for me.</td>', 'I was really surprised that more people didn''t go to Chinatown for this one. Good idea, sharpness and color. I think the business works against you on this one. Focusing on one cuttlefish/squid/whateveritis would have worked better for me.', '2004-10-04 23:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942092, 107882, 24511, '<td valign="top">Sharing one small 3100 Nikon camera with many students, we often make the same effect of reflecting flash light on dimly lit indoor subjects.  The flash seen on the desert was distracting.  Can I please have leftovers when your done?  Thanks.</td>', 'Sharing one small 3100 Nikon camera with many students, we often make the same effect of reflecting flash light on dimly lit indoor subjects.  The flash seen on the desert was distracting.  Can I please have leftovers when your done?  Thanks.', '2004-10-04 23:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(942095, 108594, 19608, '<td valign="top">Artichokes?  Wacky?  Not on your life - at least not here in California.  It''s always fun to see someone who has never eaten one figure out how it''s done.  Too bad it is past it''s prime - it would be much stronger with the more vibrant colors.  It''s still a great entry.</td>', 'Artichokes?  Wacky?  Not on your life - at least not here in California.  It''s always fun to see someone who has never eaten one figure out how it''s done.  Too bad it is past it''s prime - it would be much stronger with the more vibrant colors.  It''s still a great entry.', '2004-10-04 23:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942102, 107398, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - I give you the honor of a wacky food that would be pretty low on my list to try.  Good exposure and a very "unusual" combinateion of tastes.</td>', 'Well - I give you the honor of a wacky food that would be pretty low on my list to try.  Good exposure and a very "unusual" combinateion of tastes.', '2004-10-04 23:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942106, 108502, 17203, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Why not finish it off with a beach-scene background or play sand? Good color and sharpness. I think cropping diagonally may have worked well in terms of composition.</td>', 'Clever idea. Why not finish it off with a beach-scene background or play sand? Good color and sharpness. I think cropping diagonally may have worked well in terms of composition.', '2004-10-04 23:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(942109, 108216, 24511, '<td valign="top">At first I found the image stagnant but got excited when I noticed the water droplets on the apple and arrow.  When I see more after taking a second look at a picture, I feel rewarded somehow.  The white background makes the subject stand out but removes in my eye the artistry of color and motion that could have enhanced such a great story telling theme shot.  Thanks a lot.</td>', 'At first I found the image stagnant but got excited when I noticed the water droplets on the apple and arrow.  When I see more after taking a second look at a picture, I feel rewarded somehow.  The white background makes the subject stand out but removes in my eye the artistry of color and motion that could have enhanced such a great story telling theme shot.  Thanks a lot.', '2004-10-04 23:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(942119, 107257, 24511, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of background color that has been lacking in a lot of challenges this time arround.  I should give you 12 for punching this point home.  Great focus, shadow play and creation.  Gives a whole new meaning to "...taking a bite of the forbiden apple".  Good submission.  Thanks.</td>', 'Excellent choice of background color that has been lacking in a lot of challenges this time arround.  I should give you 12 for punching this point home.  Great focus, shadow play and creation.  Gives a whole new meaning to "...taking a bite of the forbiden apple".  Good submission.  Thanks.', '2004-10-04 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942148, 107452, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good color, exposure and choice of subject, though I''m not sold on the centered composition- it''s kinda'' static. The "spray" of pasta makes me wonder if you could have created a bouquet of some sort. The wooden fork seems out of character for some reason- you might have been better off without it. Still a good job!</td>', 'Good color, exposure and choice of subject, though I''m not sold on the centered composition- it''s kinda'' static. The "spray" of pasta makes me wonder if you could have created a bouquet of some sort. The wooden fork seems out of character for some reason- you might have been better off without it. Still a good job!', '2004-10-04 23:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(942149, 108392, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... this shot lacks, well... food. Maybe you could have leaned it more toward food with a title like, "Fire Roased Beer Can," but I don''t think the result would be much different. The static subject, lack of color or visual appeal, and pixelated edges (maybe cropped too much?) probably won''t result in a score that makes you happy. Sorry! :-(</td>', 'Hmm... this shot lacks, well... food. Maybe you could have leaned it more toward food with a title like, "Fire Roased Beer Can," but I don''t think the result would be much different. The static subject, lack of color or visual appeal, and pixelated edges (maybe cropped too much?) probably won''t result in a score that makes you happy. Sorry! :-(', '2004-10-04 23:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(942151, 107841, 24511, '<td valign="top">Is this where budding archeologists experience the thrill of digging through layers of unknown material in need of identification and later food for thought?  Some of the forground towards the left being out of focus was distracting but the top blue colors livened up the scenery.  The lighting is effective at demontrating uneven surface.  I liked the transition between the top right darks against the lower left lighter noodles.  Thanks.  Now I''m hungry.</td>', 'Is this where budding archeologists experience the thrill of digging through layers of unknown material in need of identification and later food for thought?  Some of the forground towards the left being out of focus was distracting but the top blue colors livened up the scenery.  The lighting is effective at demontrating uneven surface.  I liked the transition between the top right darks against the lower left lighter noodles.  Thanks.  Now I''m hungry.', '2004-10-04 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942158, 108363, 24511, '<td valign="top">How can so many sliced pieces be so unique?  Great photo.   Patern evident yet variety of each item keeps interest far from boring. The shadowed spacing enhances the color and shapes.  Thanks.</td>', 'How can so many sliced pieces be so unique?  Great photo.   Patern evident yet variety of each item keeps interest far from boring. The shadowed spacing enhances the color and shapes.  Thanks.', '2004-10-05 00:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942161, 108009, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well, this shot <i>does</i> meet the challenge, but you could do better with two changes. First- adjust the white balance and/or use levels to get that background more neutral. It doesn''t have to be white, but the reddish yellow color looks like a white balance problem. Second- rotate the image diagonally and use a really tight crop to eliminate the blurry part of the popsicle stick.</td>', 'Well, this shot does meet the challenge, but you could do better with two changes. First- adjust the white balance and/or use levels to get that background more neutral. It doesn''t have to be white, but the reddish yellow color looks like a white balance problem. Second- rotate the image diagonally and use a really tight crop to eliminate the blurry part of the popsicle stick.', '2004-10-05 00:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942170, 108596, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool squirrel shot, but the "food" part of your image is trivial and mostly obstructed. You might have been better off forgetting the fig- just title your shot, "Tastes Like Chicken." ;-)</td>', 'Cool squirrel shot, but the "food" part of your image is trivial and mostly obstructed. You might have been better off forgetting the fig- just title your shot, "Tastes Like Chicken." ;-)', '2004-10-05 00:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(942177, 108188, 24511, '<td valign="top">I saw little wackiness but great color combinations.  Good eye.  Pixel quality was poor on banana and hair line across large lime distracting like a scratch.  Strong texture of red fruits battles well with smoother banana and lime surfaces.  Background pattern exellent and none intrusive.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I saw little wackiness but great color combinations.  Good eye.  Pixel quality was poor on banana and hair line across large lime distracting like a scratch.  Strong texture of red fruits battles well with smoother banana and lime surfaces.  Background pattern exellent and none intrusive.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-10-05 00:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(942189, 108413, 17203, '<td valign="top">My goodness- is that a Clamnana? Clever idea, but the low (presumably incandescent) light has resulted in a reddish image with a soft focus. More light would solve the problem. I''d also crop most of the right-side background and a little off the top. (6)</td>', 'My goodness- is that a Clamnana? Clever idea, but the low (presumably incandescent) light has resulted in a reddish image with a soft focus. More light would solve the problem. I''d also crop most of the right-side background and a little off the top. (6)', '2004-10-05 00:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(942196, 107478, 17203, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great idea. It would be even better if you ditched the inconsequential glass and plate and just zoomed in on the fruit.</td>', 'LOL! Great idea. It would be even better if you ditched the inconsequential glass and plate and just zoomed in on the fruit.', '2004-10-05 00:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(942204, 107841, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ewww. Not a very appealing image, and the focus could be sharper. No offense, but you should always try to shoot a subject that the voters will WANT to see.</td>', 'Ewww. Not a very appealing image, and the focus could be sharper. No offense, but you should always try to shoot a subject that the voters will WANT to see.', '2004-10-05 00:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(942216, 107476, 17203, '<td valign="top">"Check, please!" More icky than wacky, but well-shot. The blue tones really enhance the creepy mood.</td>', '"Check, please!" More icky than wacky, but well-shot. The blue tones really enhance the creepy mood.', '2004-10-05 00:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(942220, 108040, 21643, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, patterns, and light. One of the most striking in this challenge!<br/></td>', 'Nice use of color, patterns, and light. One of the most striking in this challenge!', '2004-10-05 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942224, 107639, 21643, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and shadows.</td>', 'Good use of light and shadows.', '2004-10-05 00:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942226, 108601, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I''d really like to see this one in color though, as that''s the main attraction for this type of corn. I''d also crop about 20% off the top of the image to focus more on the corn itself.</td>', 'Good shot. I''d really like to see this one in color though, as that''s the main attraction for this type of corn. I''d also crop about 20% off the top of the image to focus more on the corn itself.', '2004-10-05 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(942228, 107257, 21643, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but also well executed. The composition and lighting are both great.<br/></td>', 'Cute idea but also well executed. The composition and lighting are both great.', '2004-10-05 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(942241, 108180, 17203, '<td valign="top">So is this an apple, an orange, or a pare? Clever idea. Good color and exposure on the top, but a little dull in he background.</td>', 'So is this an apple, an orange, or a pare? Clever idea. Good color and exposure on the top, but a little dull in he background.', '2004-10-05 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942242, 108512, 21643, '<td valign="top">I think this is such an adorable shot and such a fun idea! I think there needs to be more contrast between the egg and the background, though. At any rate, I like the photo!<br/></td>', 'I think this is such an adorable shot and such a fun idea! I think there needs to be more contrast between the egg and the background, though. At any rate, I like the photo!', '2004-10-05 00:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(942246, 107651, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little soft, but great color, concept and composition. Well done. 8</td>', 'A little soft, but great color, concept and composition. Well done. 8', '2004-10-05 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942251, 107451, 21643, '<td valign="top">A rather warped idea. ;)    This was set up well. The only thing I don''t like about it is that the mirror on the wall reflects a CD rack and the very top of the woman''s head, causing some distraction to the photo. What type of wine does one serve with stuffed penguin??<br/></td>', 'A rather warped idea. ;)    This was set up well. The only thing I don''t like about it is that the mirror on the wall reflects a CD rack and the very top of the woman''s head, causing some distraction to the photo. What type of wine does one serve with stuffed penguin??', '2004-10-05 00:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(942259, 107502, 21643, '<td valign="top">A cute idea! I would have scored this much higher if the photo didn''t look so washed out. This might have been a good photo to shoot with light coming through the white shades of a kitchen window to add some soft, natural light?<br/></td>', 'A cute idea! I would have scored this much higher if the photo didn''t look so washed out. This might have been a good photo to shoot with light coming through the white shades of a kitchen window to add some soft, natural light?', '2004-10-05 00:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942262, 107962, 17203, '<td valign="top">My pick for the blue. The background stars could use more DOF, but I appreciate the extra creativity shown by making something special out of an already unusual fruit. The simplicity and brilliant concept really make this entry shine. (10)</td>', 'My pick for the blue. The background stars could use more DOF, but I appreciate the extra creativity shown by making something special out of an already unusual fruit. The simplicity and brilliant concept really make this entry shine. (10)', '2004-10-05 00:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(942271, 108527, 21643, '<td valign="top">I had a cake like this for my birthday about 15 years ago! Nice colors in this photo. I think rearranging the objects would create better overall composition. Perhaps moving the flower pot off to the side a bit or shooting from a different angle?<br/></td>', 'I had a cake like this for my birthday about 15 years ago! Nice colors in this photo. I think rearranging the objects would create better overall composition. Perhaps moving the flower pot off to the side a bit or shooting from a different angle?', '2004-10-05 00:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(942294, 108590, 21643, '<td valign="top">Nice background color that really makes the insect stand out. I also like the angle from which you shot this photo and the way it''s cropped. Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Nice background color that really makes the insect stand out. I also like the angle from which you shot this photo and the way it''s cropped. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-05 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942298, 107962, 21643, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos in this challenge. Probably not the wackiest food, but the picture is shot very well. What did you use for lighting under the stars?<br/></td>', 'One of the best photos in this challenge. Probably not the wackiest food, but the picture is shot very well. What did you use for lighting under the stars?', '2004-10-05 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942302, 108239, 17203, '<td valign="top">The dance of a winner! I''d crop more off the right and and show the full shadow, but still- this is a ribbon. (9)</td>', 'The dance of a winner! I''d crop more off the right and and show the full shadow, but still- this is a ribbon. (9)', '2004-10-05 00:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942309, 108592, 12253, '<td valign="top">Exceptional shot--great idea and well done 2D/3D composite.   My pic for the ribbon, but what do I know ;)</td>', 'Exceptional shot--great idea and well done 2D/3D composite.   My pic for the ribbon, but what do I know ;)', '2004-10-05 00:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(942312, 107768, 12253, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how significant the lemon is, but the eating of this pig looks pretty wacky to me, so you score big.  Thankfully, I am a vegetarian.</td>', 'I don''t know how significant the lemon is, but the eating of this pig looks pretty wacky to me, so you score big.  Thankfully, I am a vegetarian.', '2004-10-05 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942345, 108600, 17203, '<td valign="top">The best and worst of the bunch. Your subject is on the extreme end of unusual foods, but it''s also extremely disgusting. The revolting nature of this shot is "going too far" for some folks, but it certainly fits the challenge. The light seems a little dim, too.</td>', 'The best and worst of the bunch. Your subject is on the extreme end of unusual foods, but it''s also extremely disgusting. The revolting nature of this shot is "going too far" for some folks, but it certainly fits the challenge. The light seems a little dim, too.', '2004-10-05 01:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942348, 107572, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ah, a food unit. I like the unusual angle and splash of color, but I''d prefer just a little more DOF.</td>', 'Ah, a food unit. I like the unusual angle and splash of color, but I''d prefer just a little more DOF.', '2004-10-05 01:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(942358, 108588, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but the execution could be better. The bluish cast is the biggest problem, and a simpler composition (maybe diagonal) would help.</td>', 'A good idea, but the execution could be better. The bluish cast is the biggest problem, and a simpler composition (maybe diagonal) would help.', '2004-10-05 01:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942457, 107913, 4267, '<td valign="top">use the angle of the light and after shooting adjust the contrast and brightness to wash the wrinkles out</td>', 'use the angle of the light and after shooting adjust the contrast and brightness to wash the wrinkles out', '2004-10-05 03:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(942459, 107970, 4267, '<td valign="top">the flash ruins it.. try natural or off camera lighting</td>', 'the flash ruins it.. try natural or off camera lighting', '2004-10-05 03:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942461, 108413, 4267, '<td valign="top">ha good composition...it does  needs to be a bit closer so the image is a lot sharper</td>', 'ha good composition...it does  needs to be a bit closer so the image is a lot sharper', '2004-10-05 04:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(942462, 108596, 4267, '<td valign="top">the food really isn''t the subject of the photo.. sorry</td>', 'the food really isn''t the subject of the photo.. sorry', '2004-10-05 04:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(942463, 107798, 4267, '<td valign="top">you need more depth of your field of focus.. crank the F-Stop up to a uch higher setting</td>', 'you need more depth of your field of focus.. crank the F-Stop up to a uch higher setting', '2004-10-05 04:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(942466, 108363, 4267, '<td valign="top">might be even cooerl if you capped the other ends and blasted bright light from behind the okra... tnoing down the fore ground light to accent the light from behind of course (7)... bumping it to 8 since most of the other photos this week are terrible... your my 3rd place</td>', 'might be even cooerl if you capped the other ends and blasted bright light from behind the okra... tnoing down the fore ground light to accent the light from behind of course (7)... bumping it to 8 since most of the other photos this week are terrible... your my 3rd place', '2004-10-05 04:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(942467, 107257, 4267, '<td valign="top">hmm difficult... while the challenge says you can create your own culinary delight, to me the creation should be edible since it is food.. metal spikes not being edible leaves me feeling that the challenge was not well met... while creatively it is a good idea... I really like the angle and amount of light... it really works well... a red background might work better than the blue as red/green are contrasting colors... overall (7) bumping this to a 9 (my 2nd place) since there are sooooo many terrible photos this week... good luck!</td>', 'hmm difficult... while the challenge says you can create your own culinary delight, to me the creation should be edible since it is food.. metal spikes not being edible leaves me feeling that the challenge was not well met... while creatively it is a good idea... I really like the angle and amount of light... it really works well... a red background might work better than the blue as red/green are contrasting colors... overall (7) bumping this to a 9 (my 2nd place) since there are sooooo many terrible photos this week... good luck!', '2004-10-05 04:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(942486, 108005, 22125, '<td valign="top">Did it taste as ferral as it looks?</td>', 'Did it taste as ferral as it looks?', '2004-10-05 05:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942488, 108601, 19952, '<td valign="top">I think you made an excellent choice to go duotone with this shot. It looks great and the contrast came out really well, despite some of the lighter kernels blowing out just a bit. This is a really nice shot - one of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'I think you made an excellent choice to go duotone with this shot. It looks great and the contrast came out really well, despite some of the lighter kernels blowing out just a bit. This is a really nice shot - one of my favorites in the challenge.', '2004-10-05 05:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(942489, 108288, 22125, '<td valign="top">If you could have cropped the background out a little more I think it would have been better.  Bet the little girl loved it - looks pretty yummy!</td>', 'If you could have cropped the background out a little more I think it would have been better.  Bet the little girl loved it - looks pretty yummy!', '2004-10-05 05:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942500, 107451, 22125, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I believe the mirror ruined what would have been quite a good pic.  Funny! 7</td>', 'Unfortunately I believe the mirror ruined what would have been quite a good pic.  Funny! 7', '2004-10-05 06:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942501, 107478, 22125, '<td valign="top">Pic of the basket of fruit would have probably been more effective.  Funny though - very original</td>', 'Pic of the basket of fruit would have probably been more effective.  Funny though - very original', '2004-10-05 06:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(942502, 107692, 22125, '<td valign="top">Messy background - cool veg!</td>', 'Messy background - cool veg!', '2004-10-05 06:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942503, 107104, 22125, '<td valign="top">Yummy</td>', 'Yummy', '2004-10-05 06:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(942505, 107476, 22125, '<td valign="top">Translated your title reads what?  Just out of interest!</td>', 'Translated your title reads what?  Just out of interest!', '2004-10-05 06:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(942615, 108286, 27586, '<td valign="top">I like shis "snap", chew carefully</td>', 'I like shis "snap", chew carefully', '2004-10-05 08:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942616, 108180, 27586, '<td valign="top">Very clever, yet simple.</td>', 'Very clever, yet simple.', '2004-10-05 08:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(942646, 108366, 25623, '<td valign="top">That green stuff will always be the death of me!  HOT!</td>', 'That green stuff will always be the death of me!  HOT!', '2004-10-05 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(942667, 107451, 26361, '<td valign="top">Amusing concept.  The sepia tone gives a nice warm glow to the photo.  The reflection of her head in the mirror is very distracting, maybe a different angle would help that.</td>', 'Amusing concept.  The sepia tone gives a nice warm glow to the photo.  The reflection of her head in the mirror is very distracting, maybe a different angle would help that.', '2004-10-05 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942679, 107319, 26361, '<td valign="top">The stain on the tablecloth is very distracting. A crop allowing more negative space to the left and bottom of the banana would better show-off the banana.</td>', 'The stain on the tablecloth is very distracting. A crop allowing more negative space to the left and bottom of the banana would better show-off the banana.', '2004-10-05 10:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942728, 108413, 3546, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, but I think it''s too dark.  Better lighting would help, IMHO.</td>', 'I like this concept, but I think it''s too dark.  Better lighting would help, IMHO.', '2004-10-05 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(942772, 108525, 26361, '<td valign="top">Always wondered if the litterbox cake really did look like one, and it does.  Would have been better without so tight a crop to show more newspaper around the cake.</td>', 'Always wondered if the litterbox cake really did look like one, and it does.  Would have been better without so tight a crop to show more newspaper around the cake.', '2004-10-05 11:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942780, 107639, 26361, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  A plate of a different color plate might have allowed more contrast to the "eyes" and made it look less busy.</td>', 'Great concept.  A plate of a different color plate might have allowed more contrast to the "eyes" and made it look less busy.', '2004-10-05 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(942793, 108512, 24789, '<td valign="top">Damn, Damn, Damn, I soooo want to give this a higher score, I LOVE the concept, but the prints are wrong, if they were chicken prints it would have gotten an 8 or 9 from me, as it is, 6, sorry!<br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Damn, Damn, Damn, I soooo want to give this a higher score, I LOVE the concept, but the prints are wrong, if they were chicken prints it would have gotten an 8 or 9 from me, as it is, 6, sorry!Mike', '2004-10-05 11:59:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(942827, 107604, 14773, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about the quality [probably lighting] of this photo that doesn''t do it.   It looks really heavy/dark ..</td>', 'There''s just something about the quality [probably lighting] of this photo that doesn''t do it.   It looks really heavy/dark ..', '2004-10-05 12:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942829, 108284, 14773, '<td valign="top">Like the concept, not entirely sold on the composition, though.  I like the choice of background.</td>', 'Like the concept, not entirely sold on the composition, though.  I like the choice of background.', '2004-10-05 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(942835, 107532, 14773, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''m fond of the composition, but mostly it''s poor lighting.  Direct flash is [for all intensive purposes] very bad. Not just for you, for everyone!  The flowers in the front are bright white while everything is unintentionally dark.</td>', 'I can''t say I''m fond of the composition, but mostly it''s poor lighting.  Direct flash is [for all intensive purposes] very bad. Not just for you, for everyone!  The flowers in the front are bright white while everything is unintentionally dark.', '2004-10-05 12:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(942837, 108528, 14773, '<td valign="top">Errrr long - what?<br/>lol how very phalic</td>', 'Errrr long - what?lol how very phalic', '2004-10-05 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942843, 107959, 14773, '<td valign="top">uh, where''d they get orange squid?</td>', 'uh, where''d they get orange squid?', '2004-10-05 12:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(942847, 107496, 8599, '<td valign="top">nice lips color</td>', 'nice lips color', '2004-10-05 12:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942848, 108409, 14773, '<td valign="top">mmmm this looks yummy..I like the composition, maybe could do without the plate of food behind it, but it''s not a big problem.  I think with a wee better lighting it could rock, or maybe it''s just because of resizing that it looks off.</td>', 'mmmm this looks yummy..I like the composition, maybe could do without the plate of food behind it, but it''s not a big problem.  I think with a wee better lighting it could rock, or maybe it''s just because of resizing that it looks off.', '2004-10-05 12:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(942854, 108180, 14773, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and when you get more knowledge about lighting I''d suggest doing a reshoot. Needs a stronger composition like a different angle and even lighting.</td>', 'Cool idea and when you get more knowledge about lighting I''d suggest doing a reshoot. Needs a stronger composition like a different angle and even lighting.', '2004-10-05 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(942857, 108316, 26361, '<td valign="top">What a great play area.  Would love to show a bit more corn in the foreground.  Background needed blurred so as not to distract from the little girl throwing the corn.</td>', 'What a great play area.  Would love to show a bit more corn in the foreground.  Background needed blurred so as not to distract from the little girl throwing the corn.', '2004-10-05 12:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(942859, 108601, 14773, '<td valign="top">I love all the texture....there''s lots of contrast but still a lot of detail. I like the way the ''white'' bits of the front corn are a bit blown out...7</td>', 'I love all the texture....there''s lots of contrast but still a lot of detail. I like the way the ''white'' bits of the front corn are a bit blown out...7', '2004-10-05 12:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942866, 108316, 14773, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute shot of the girl. For my own personal use I''d cut her out, blur the background so it''s more interesting and not distracting, then paste her back in [so she''s still in focus].</td>', 'This is such a cute shot of the girl. For my own personal use I''d cut her out, blur the background so it''s more interesting and not distracting, then paste her back in [so she''s still in focus].', '2004-10-05 12:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(942869, 107768, 14773, '<td valign="top">I love pork...but....the roasted head of any animal is just not pallate pleasing to me!</td>', 'I love pork...but....the roasted head of any animal is just not pallate pleasing to me!', '2004-10-05 12:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(942872, 108441, 14773, '<td valign="top">You''ve almost got it.  The stuff in the background [including the label on the water bottle] really take away though.  Needs some better lighting as well. The presentation of the ''meal'' is good, though.  Nice choice of plates.</td>', 'You''ve almost got it.  The stuff in the background [including the label on the water bottle] really take away though.  Needs some better lighting as well. The presentation of the ''meal'' is good, though.  Nice choice of plates.', '2004-10-05 12:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(942873, 108600, 14773, '<td valign="top">Is this to be ''whacky'' or do people eat this?  This image is a bit on the dark side, maybe some better lighting would show more detail.</td>', 'Is this to be ''whacky'' or do people eat this?  This image is a bit on the dark side, maybe some better lighting would show more detail.', '2004-10-05 12:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942876, 108215, 14773, '<td valign="top">This is cool, but the seed sort of ruins it for me.  But I do really like the idea.</td>', 'This is cool, but the seed sort of ruins it for me.  But I do really like the idea.', '2004-10-05 12:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
