(943999, 107275, 21643, '<td valign="top">That''s definitely a wacky food. I think a closer crop (maybe even a portrait orientation rather than landscape?) and different angle might make the photo more dramatic. I''m also curious how this picture might look if it were shot from just a bit lower so that we''re looking up at the heap of ice cream and pickles? None of these are necessarily suggestions but more of questions. I think would be a fun picture to experiment with the composition. Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'That''s definitely a wacky food. I think a closer crop (maybe even a portrait orientation rather than landscape?) and different angle might make the photo more dramatic. I''m also curious how this picture might look if it were shot from just a bit lower so that we''re looking up at the heap of ice cream and pickles? None of these are necessarily suggestions but more of questions. I think would be a fun picture to experiment with the composition. Good luck in the challenge. ', '2004-10-05 23:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
