(944012, 108193, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very clever and well done.  I like the approach, but I would ahve liked to had more of a closeup with the girls face and turtle.  It''s almost secondary to the box to see the little guy in the spoon, but that''s IMHO important to making this more than a fake product box shot.</td>', 'Very clever and well done.  I like the approach, but I would ahve liked to had more of a closeup with the girls face and turtle.  It''s almost secondary to the box to see the little guy in the spoon, but that''s IMHO important to making this more than a fake product box shot.', '2004-10-05 23:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
