(944028, 108556, 12253, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call real finger foods!  Nice job.</td>', 'Now that''s what I call real finger foods!  Nice job.', '2004-10-06 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(944033, 108525, 25183, '<td valign="top">Too funny...and nauseating!</td>', 'Too funny...and nauseating!', '2004-10-06 00:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(944044, 108085, 17203, '<td valign="top">Clever play in the title, but this food isn''t all that wacky for a cat- it''s pretty standard fare. That said, you might have tried shooting with the cat directly facing you for a little more interest.</td>', 'Clever play in the title, but this food isn''t all that wacky for a cat- it''s pretty standard fare. That said, you might have tried shooting with the cat directly facing you for a little more interest.', '2004-10-06 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(944047, 108040, 17203, '<td valign="top">Excellent play of colors and shapes, and a nice choice of background. One of the better entries. The highlights under the gummy bears are a little distracting, and you should clone out the dust specks on the bottom left.</td>', 'Excellent play of colors and shapes, and a nice choice of background. One of the better entries. The highlights under the gummy bears are a little distracting, and you should clone out the dust specks on the bottom left.', '2004-10-06 00:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(944050, 108580, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... even with the title, I can''t tell what this is. Sorry, but it just looks like a brown blob with chocolate sauce over it. While I do like diagonal compositions, this one seems a little awkward because the perspective makes the plate look squashed when you rotate it. A nice shadow under the plate would add a good sense of depth, too.</td>', 'Hmm... even with the title, I can''t tell what this is. Sorry, but it just looks like a brown blob with chocolate sauce over it. While I do like diagonal compositions, this one seems a little awkward because the perspective makes the plate look squashed when you rotate it. A nice shadow under the plate would add a good sense of depth, too.', '2004-10-06 00:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(944053, 108362, 17203, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. If you have kids, I''m sure they were worried about your mental state. The diagonal composition is good, but the horizon isn''t rotated enough to look intentional. Some blown out highlights and soft focus at lower left, but still a fun and creative image.</td>', 'Interesting idea. If you have kids, I''m sure they were worried about your mental state. The diagonal composition is good, but the horizon isn''t rotated enough to look intentional. Some blown out highlights and soft focus at lower left, but still a fun and creative image.', '2004-10-06 00:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(944055, 108433, 17203, '<td valign="top">You''re a good cake, Charlie Brown. Very creative. Wish I could see little more detail in the highlights.</td>', 'You''re a good cake, Charlie Brown. Very creative. Wish I could see little more detail in the highlights.', '2004-10-06 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(944057, 108086, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Scary. Funny thing some restaurant is featuring these fellows as a specialty. I would have like to have seen more sharpness as could have been easily obtained by a top view. regardless, you have captured the essence here.</td>', 'returning for comments. Scary. Funny thing some restaurant is featuring these fellows as a specialty. I would have like to have seen more sharpness as could have been easily obtained by a top view. regardless, you have captured the essence here.', '2004-10-06 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(944059, 107644, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the best in this group, even if it isn''t "people food." A little on the dark side, but it seems to help the mood. I don''t really understand the relationship between the nest and the fish- maybe it''s just me?</td>', 'One of the best in this group, even if it isn''t "people food." A little on the dark side, but it seems to help the mood. I don''t really understand the relationship between the nest and the fish- maybe it''s just me?', '2004-10-06 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(944069, 108216, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>Very mixed feelings on this one. A very good image with great technique, great composition and great color but what a subject. It is like a deception, I reach for the apple and bang...wacko food. lol Bumping up to 6<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-06 00:12:22.</i></td>', 'returning for commentsVery mixed feelings on this one. A very good image with great technique, great composition and great color but what a subject. It is like a deception, I reach for the apple and bang...wacko food. lol Bumping up to 6', '2004-10-06 00:38:05.000000', '2004-10-06 01:12:22.000000', 1),
(944070, 108525, 10263, '<td valign="top">I love it :) funny and creative!</td>', 'I love it :) funny and creative!', '2004-10-06 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(944072, 108581, 17203, '<td valign="top">A GREAT idea, but I''ll bet a lot of people will miss it because the cake is a little too obscure. All you really had to do is get a nice cake and stick the claws in it. Maybe even decorate the cake to <i>look</i> like a crab, and then add the claws.</td>', 'A GREAT idea, but I''ll bet a lot of people will miss it because the cake is a little too obscure. All you really had to do is get a nice cake and stick the claws in it. Maybe even decorate the cake to look like a crab, and then add the claws.', '2004-10-06 00:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(944081, 107847, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet that''s yummy, but it loses some appeal because the brown center tends to look like a rotten core. The highlights are a bit hot for my taste, but pretty good overall.</td>', 'I''ll bet that''s yummy, but it loses some appeal because the brown center tends to look like a rotten core. The highlights are a bit hot for my taste, but pretty good overall.', '2004-10-06 00:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(944082, 108450, 25906, '<td valign="top">I think it should have been turned a tad bit to the left to make it vertical.-Great photo though~9</td>', 'I think it should have been turned a tad bit to the left to make it vertical.-Great photo though~9', '2004-10-06 00:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(944087, 108306, 25906, '<td valign="top">Much too out of focus for my tastes.~4</td>', 'Much too out of focus for my tastes.~4', '2004-10-06 00:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(944089, 108432, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Nice colors, great composition.</td>', 'This is nice. Nice colors, great composition.', '2004-10-06 00:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(944090, 108603, 16965, '<td valign="top">Yum :)</td>', 'Yum :)', '2004-10-06 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(944092, 107496, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/> <br/> <br/>Excellent and lethal technique use here to scare the hell out of the casual voter. The composition is great although not as delectable as the sensuos lips would have us believe. There are not many in this site that can accomplish this type of shot.  What is that white goop on the lower lip? Previous crunch results. lol</td>', 'returning for comments  Excellent and lethal technique use here to scare the hell out of the casual voter. The composition is great although not as delectable as the sensuos lips would have us believe. There are not many in this site that can accomplish this type of shot.  What is that white goop on the lower lip? Previous crunch results. lol', '2004-10-06 00:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(944093, 107962, 25906, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, it is my favorite out of the group. Great lighting. ~10</td>', 'I really like this photo, it is my favorite out of the group. Great lighting. ~10', '2004-10-06 00:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(944095, 107597, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative in the bunch. I really wish you had placed the club behind the gourds(?) so I could see it better. The poor focus on the club is distracting because it''s such a major element.</td>', 'One of the most creative in the bunch. I really wish you had placed the club behind the gourds(?) so I could see it better. The poor focus on the club is distracting because it''s such a major element.', '2004-10-06 00:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(944098, 107496, 25906, '<td valign="top">I love the red. This is a great photo, the only thing I don''t like is the grasshopper, and that is only because they are the most annoying insect ever, I wish you lots of luck for this photo.  ~10</td>', 'I love the red. This is a great photo, the only thing I don''t like is the grasshopper, and that is only because they are the most annoying insect ever, I wish you lots of luck for this photo.  ~10', '2004-10-06 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
