(944103, 107644, 25906, '<td valign="top">I really like the natural tones of this photo. I like the contrast between the fish and the nest.  I wish you the best of luck.~10</td>', 'I really like the natural tones of this photo. I like the contrast between the fish and the nest.  I wish you the best of luck.~10', '2004-10-06 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
