(944107, 108565, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''ve had quite a few of those- yum. The honey is hard to see, so a lot of people are going to wonder what the H is for. There''s a lot going on here- I think you''d score better with fewer elements in the frame, and a simpler plate. When I first saw the title, I expected some camera equipment from B&amp;H to be on the sandwich. LOL</td>', 'I''ve had quite a few of those- yum. The honey is hard to see, so a lot of people are going to wonder what the H is for. There''s a lot going on here- I think you''d score better with fewer elements in the frame, and a simpler plate. When I first saw the title, I expected some camera equipment from B&H to be on the sandwich. LOL', '2004-10-06 00:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(944109, 108530, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>Now, this is wacky without turning gross. Not that gross has a place in the wacky, but your route has more taste. I can at least eat it if I get hungry. Mm..you may be starting a trend, the wacky food cook book.</td>', 'returning for commentsNow, this is wacky without turning gross. Not that gross has a place in the wacky, but your route has more taste. I can at least eat it if I get hungry. Mm..you may be starting a trend, the wacky food cook book.', '2004-10-06 00:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
