(944140, 107257, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard of cactus pears, but this is something new. That would make one dangerous pie! Good sharpness and DOF. I like the contrasting apple green and purple tones, though I wish there had been a little more light on the right side- it''s <i>really</i> dark over there. Bumping to a 9 for the creative simplicity.</td>', 'I''ve heard of cactus pears, but this is something new. That would make one dangerous pie! Good sharpness and DOF. I like the contrasting apple green and purple tones, though I wish there had been a little more light on the right side- it''s really dark over there. Bumping to a 9 for the creative simplicity.', '2004-10-06 00:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
